# New campaign (2026-08-15, see campaign/PLAN.md): tracing is off
# (fresh_server_replay.py --no-trace-proposals) so run dirs are ~25KB, not
# the ~1-1.5MB/run they'd be with proposals.jsonl -- but still not tracked in
# git (root disk sits at 96% full; git blobs are a real, avoidable cost, and
# these runs are regeneratable from the campaign scripts + prompts). Old,
# already-tracked runs under old_runs/ are untouched by this rule.
runs/**

